  "scope": "Complete simplified-Chinese chapter text supplied by the edition, with no new translation or silent character correction.",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 1,
      "text": "从彼波罗奈国东行还到巴连弗邑。",
      "textSha256": "c017cd70457e44a1e8f86593d092cf83d3dd29fa1c8b535ea5f18d139885c9f8",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[1]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 431,
          "endByte": 479,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "c4e64f5323063003c6c3ebd1367abfbcd5f226ce443d6004bb16e97b5ebe09a8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 2,
      "text": "法显本求戒律。 而北天竺诸国。 皆师师口传。 无本可写。",
      "textSha256": "fe0baa972e9fc628f837c9c1d206f0f4380a31fb4c62283bbcc9dc63a150b56b",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[2]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 891,
          "endByte": 972,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "533f941c94a92bfd90faa290765fa23a3ffa9f4520714d5e007b931fd176011e"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 3,
      "text": "是以远涉。 乃至中天竺。 于此摩诃衍僧伽蓝得一部律。 是摩诃僧祇众律。 佛在世时最初大众所行也。",
      "textSha256": "97a82a9e3f10e861e19db5264cff493a28f29ca9dd8dde2d78872a1f2a3c8c3c",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[3]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 1588,
          "endByte": 1727,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "558f39b40eb93123160214bfdf1b6578750fa67b42206ed3cc8768abbc3a943d"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 4,
      "text": "于祗洹精舍传其本。 自余十八部。 各有师资。",
      "textSha256": "b8447ffea64a7151ec3527537cf97aa1d437d2588f086e8be14dc2d05be41ffc",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[4]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2304,
          "endByte": 2369,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "d14918574ac25ea6f258706df1bf1a089a8126563945e44a56030c447806b316"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 5,
      "text": "大归不异。 然小小不同。 或用开塞但此最。 是广说备悉者。",
      "textSha256": "d19d089d598ebb41c9210549e45ae85edbb723db42e4e20e0990b91256975f19",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[5]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 2837,
          "endByte": 2921,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "a152ff8193a8251a83a0f579d4e1248d88b08f2dde21d8660fffbc524808e0fa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 6,
      "text": "复得一部抄律。 可七千偈。 是萨婆多众律。 即此秦地众僧所行者也。 亦皆师师口相传授。 不书之于文字。",
      "textSha256": "eb712e33428c31e83fd049fe62eb35fbfaaf4ca6872d08ff664598386d7e1a1a",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[6]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 3570,
          "endByte": 3716,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "cbd1e08f44aa03dcb0ca5948ce0e303ba1b905914ced359f43a45eeff0ee2f9c"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 7,
      "text": "复于此众中得杂阿毗昙心。 可六千偈。",
      "textSha256": "7702059077a5649f02ef9d633a9facec4a176c7118e830e5872689cee8062083",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[7]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4308,
          "endByte": 4363,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "ecc2a0109beaee6f6cabf80ac3702100115d1c92dee0e3684b7aeff09a178080"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 8,
      "text": "又得一部经。 二千五百偈。 又得一卷方等般泥洹经。 可五千偈。 又得摩诃僧祇阿毗昙。",
      "textSha256": "4a5e5f13d7ae070107e95bc6e1e5e4eefca10848163866eb90fa20a1cbe39e79",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[8]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 4843,
          "endByte": 4964,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "303ee768e5144375e0fa99eecc5407a497c59e5df13d7bd12c8d0f4c70bef7e8"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 9,
      "text": "故法显住此三年。 学梵书、梵语。 写律。",
      "textSha256": "993ecdbb52177e17b8682d14131af58a304797c0ddc5b5b2b1705e5c22977576",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[9]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 5576,
          "endByte": 5635,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "e13a865e0c163295863ac7c02c6e6d5de1c9f5b8ec4277b9b2fb13a9f796776f"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 10,
      "text": "道整既到中国。 见沙门法则。 众僧威仪。 触事可观。 乃追叹秦土边地。 众僧戒律残缺。",
      "textSha256": "30ee2249fbc424c3ff6da767df310b2af47fbf13ee53032a88b6b2835b98328b",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[10]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 6148,
          "endByte": 6270,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "8a43a7aac4c1a25889652d0df5ca81b8502316a4c1b1bff4fa2b198f5f493f55"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 11,
      "text": "誓言自今已去至得佛。 愿不生边地。 故遂停不归。",
      "textSha256": "a8ea4916976997efcf72d858635a923b03a4a5a3a8a57080aa54a523024ee9bb",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[11]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 6861,
          "endByte": 6932,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "441bac92d2f9df60651f2801f1a285bdf23b7bed8d8058cd6626efd0f2d50e73"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 36,
      "segment": 12,
      "text": "法显本心。 欲令戒律流通汉地。 于是独还。",
      "textSha256": "592fc9aa55b2db2f608b51773f6d0fe5eaf3d3db8259d4fe860a858d08807205",
      "sourceAssignment": "schin[12]",
      "sourceSpans": [
        {
          "startByte": 7309,
          "endByte": 7371,
          "kind": "javascript-string-literal",
          "sha256": "1ea741e965ff4bd3b20b58c114e087a4e51d60e7ffa318e53d126beea7bbbae3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
